+        /// Denied-cast feedback targets an always-visible portion of the mana indicator (the
+        /// bar background/frame behind the fill Image, when one is wired as its parent) so the
+        /// flash stays readable even when CurrentMana is 0 and the fill Image itself has no
+        /// visible fill pixels to recolor. Falls back to the fill Image directly when no such
